      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the multilayer separator</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">further comprises at least one coating on one side or two sides of the multilayer separator, and the coating comprises one or two of inorganic particles and polymers.</span>
