        <span itemprop="subject">the second porous substrate</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">has a broken membrane temperature of higher than 145° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the second porous substrate is in a range of 145° C. to 240° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the second porous substrate is in a range of 145° C. to 230° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the second porous substrate is in a range of 145° C. to 220° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the second porous substrate is in a range of 145° C. to 210° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the second porous substrate is in a range of 145° C. to 200° C.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0039">
