      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the broken membrane temperature of the second porous substrate</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is in a range of 145° C. to 190° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the second porous substrate is in a range of 145° C. to 180° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the second porous substrate is in a range of 145° C. to 170° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the second porous substrate is in a range of 145° C. to 160° C. In some embodiments, the second porous substrate has a broken membrane temperature of 155° C.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0039">
