      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the multilayer separator</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">has a thickness of 5  ⁇ m to 30  ⁇ m. In some embodiments, the multilayer separator has a thickness of 8  ⁇ m to 20  ⁇ m. In some embodiments, the multilayer separator has a thickness of 8  ⁇ m to 18  ⁇ m. In some embodiments, the multilayer separator has a thickness of 8  ⁇ m to 16  ⁇ m. In some embodiments, the multilayer separator has a thickness of 8  ⁇ m to 14  ⁇ m. In some embodiments, the multilayer separator has a thickness of 12  ⁇ m.</span>
