        <span itemprop="definition">has a broken membrane temperature of higher than 145° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the multilayer separator is in a range of 145° C. to 250° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the multilayer separator is in a range of 145° C. to 240° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the multilayer separator is in a range of 145° C. to 230° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the multilayer separator is in a range of 145° C. to 220° C. In some embodiments, the broken membrane temperature of the multilayer separator is in a range of 145° C. to 210° C.</span>
